The Stack &amp;amp; Architecture
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; React, Vite, Tailwind CSS for ultra-fast load times and responsiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
