Learning about verified cryptocurrency exchange accounts can provide a useful introduction to several areas of digital literacy.&lt;br&gt;
The first is understanding digital identity. A person's online accounts may contain identifying information that connects the account with an individual. Learning how that relationship works is an important modern technology skill.&lt;br&gt;
