&lt;li&gt;Review Your Legitimate Personal Information
For accounts you personally maintain, review whether your identifying and contact information is accurate.
Pay attention to names, addresses, dates, and other information that a particular provider requires.
If your circumstances have changed, learn what the provider's official process requires for updating the information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the Verification Process
Study the provider's explanation of its verification requirements before attempting to complete an account process.
